 other direction  oh wow that's sick well this is going to  be great content for me totally i'm  loving all of these new updates coming  to fifa 23 from women's football to new  shooting mechanics to all new ways to  defend and your first look at what  hypermotion 2 is bringing to the game  that does it from the pitch derek back  to you thank you very much for that  can't wait to lend our commentary to the  world's game this year  [Music]  you

